{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52237","headline":"颂六十二首 六十二 · 道世","name":"颂六十二首 六十二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"龚胜无遗生，季业有穷尽。\n嵇叟理既迫，霍子命亦殒。\n屡屡厚霜指，纳纳冲风菌。\n邂逅竟既时，修短非所慜。\n恨我君子志，不得严上泯。\n送心正觉前，斯痛久已忍。\n既知人我空，何愁心不谨。\n唯愿乘来生，怨亲同诚朕。\n（见同书卷一百十五《舍身篇》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"道世","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52237.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52237","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}